          "comment": "[Playbook] The three-year term in Section 4.0 can only be exited for cause or by six months' non-renewal notice, so we have added a customer right to terminate for convenience on thirty (30) days' notice with a refund of prepaid amounts, consistent with our playbook position that we can exit on notice without penalty. Wind-down and pricing on exit remain governed by Sections 5.2 and 5.3; if 30 days is too short we can discuss 60-90 days' notice as a fallback.",
