              "numbering": "5.4",
              "asHeading": false,
              "text": "5.4 Termination for Convenience. In addition to the rights set forth in Section 5.1, IBM may terminate this Agreement, any Product Attachment, or any Purchase Order for its convenience, in whole or in part, upon thirty (30) Days prior written notice to MSL, without payment of any termination penalty or early termination charge. MSL shall have no right to terminate this Agreement, any Product Attachment, or any Purchase Order for convenience during the term. Upon termination by IBM under this Section 5.4, MSL shall refund to IBM any amounts prepaid by IBM for the period after the effective date of termination, and the rights and obligations of the Parties shall otherwise be as set forth in Sections 5.2 and 5.3, which shall apply to such termination as if it were an expiration of this Agreement."
